WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.235 --> 00:00:02.818
(gentle music)

00:00:17.881 --> 00:00:19.675
- [Voiceover] Read this.

00:00:19.675 --> 00:00:20.508
- Okay.

00:00:20.508 --> 00:00:22.676
- [Voiceover] Can you read it out loud?

00:00:22.676 --> 00:00:24.919
- I'm suspicious.

00:00:24.919 --> 00:00:28.147
- Thank you for always
having such a warm smile.

00:00:28.147 --> 00:00:29.592
