00:00:33.201 --> 00:00:35.241
- Always have the cutest outfits.

00:00:35.241 --> 00:00:36.294
Oh God.

00:00:36.294 --> 00:00:37.711
- Thank you, Ari.

00:00:41.035 --> 00:00:42.832
- Aw, you're so sweet.

00:00:42.832 --> 00:00:45.415
(gentle music)

00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:54.916
(woman laughing)

